able": {}, "Node name for S&R": "easy showAnything"}, "order": 17}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "output", "label": "output", "type": "*", "localized_name": "output"}], "size": [575.9443359375, 405.676513671875], "pos": [4280.66650390625, 1830.80615234375], "widgets_values": ["The image is a horizontal editorial art card, a soft charcoal and graphite hand-drawn portrait of a young woman set on a textured cream paper sheet with gently rounded corners, the whole frame carrying the look of a quiet minimalist sketchbook page. The background is an off-white, lightly grainy paper surface with a faint warm tone, the charcoal dust and smudge marks sitting on it like real pigment, and the edges of the card are softly rounded as if printed on a small postcard. Across the upper-left, a loose handwritten title in black marker reads \"Still Here\" on two stacked lines, the strokes uneven and slightly slanted with a short underline dash beneath. In the centre stands the woman herself, drawn from the shoulders up in dense charcoal hatching, her long hair parted in the middle and falling in two dark masses around her face, the strands rendered as thousands of fine black lines against the pale paper, with a small butterfly-shaped hair clip perched near the upper-left of her hairline suggested by a few lighter strokes. Her face is left mostly as the bare paper, the features built up with soft shading around the eyes, nose and lips, her gaze meeting the viewer with a calm, neutral expression, her brows drawn as two short dark arcs and her lips as a single smudged mark. She wears a low scoop-necked top whose leopard-like spotted pattern is translated into rough stippled charcoal dots and hatched shading across the chest and shoulders, the neckline traced in a clean curved line. At her throat a thin necklace hangs, drawn as a single faint curve with a tiny pendant dot at its centre. In the lower-left, two small lines of fine serif caption text read \"Same me.\" and \"A quieter day.\", set in a muted grey. On the right side of the frame, a small label reads \"NO. 01\" in spaced caps with a thin rule beneath it, and below that a short stacked block of tiny serif text reads \"Some faces carry\", \"silent stories.\" The lighting is flat, even ambient light with no strong directional source, the only shadows being the artist's own charcoal shading on the hair and the soft smudges under the chin and along the neck, while the paper itself stays uniformly lit. The overall composition is balanced and serene, a hand-drawn charcoal portrait centred between sparse handwritten annotations on a warm cream card, the restrained black-on-cream palette and the quiet, contemplative mood of a personal sketchbook page."], "inputs": [{"shape": 7, "name": "anything", "link": 104, "label": "输入任何", "type": "*", "localized_name": "anything"}], "flags": {}, "id": 51, "type": "easy showAnything", "properties": {"cnr_id": "comfyui-easy-use", "ver": "450b1ce4ce43b2280521c87f5fa388a898fb2ad2", "widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "easy showAnything"}, "order": 15}, {"outputs": [], "color": "#432", "widgets_values": ["runninghub目前有问题，发布节点就移位，暂时需要手动重新添加一次Qwen Image 2.1 Prompt Enhancer节点，预计明天才能修复"], "inputs": [], "flags": {}, "type": "Note", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#653", "size": [330.8243713378906, 108.29026794433594], "pos": [3783.54833984375, 1663.5517578125], "id": 66, "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}}, "order": 1}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [], "size": [295.2300720214844, 82], "pos": [4579.34033203125, 2500.712890625], "widgets_values": ["", "output_text"], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "text"}, "name": "text", "link": 106, "label": "text", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "text"}, {"widget": {"name": "output_name"}, "name": "output_name", "label": "output_name", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "output_name"}], "flags": {}, "id": 68, "type": "ShellAgentPluginOutputText", "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "ShellAgen